{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0198","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000001ce:text","row":29367,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"廊下に霧が立っていた。","en":"Kiri stood in the hallway.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800195","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00001","en":"Kiri was standing in the corridor.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000204:text","row":29368,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧ちん……」","en":"“Kiri-kins……”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800196","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Kiri-chin...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000028b:text","row":29369,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"キッ、とにらまれた。","en":"She shot me a glare.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800197","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00003","en":"Glare!, and I'm put under observation.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000043d:text","row":29370,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"負けじと俺もにらみかえした。","en":"Not to be outdone, I glared right back.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800198","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00004","en":"Undaunted, I return her a glare.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000004fa:text","row":29371,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"ババババババババッ！！（心理効果）","en":"Babababababababa!! (Psychological effect.)","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800199","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00005","en":"DrRrRrRrRrRrRrRrRill!!! (psychological effect)","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000534:text","row":29372,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"視線の応酬。","en":"A crossfire of gazes.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800200","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00006","en":"Back and forth of sights.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000558:text","row":29373,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"圧力ある敵意が、衝突しあって中間地点で渦を巻く。","en":"Our hostile pressure collided and churned into a vortex at the midpoint.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800201","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00007","en":"Hostilities with pressure, coiling into an eddy at the midpoint where they collide.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000005a0:text","row":29374,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"小娘めっ！！","en":"You little brat!!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800202","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00008","en":"Damn wee lass!!!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000005c4:text","row":29375,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"懐に手を入れる。","en":"I slipped a hand inside my jacket.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800203","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00009","en":"I reach into my breast pocket.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000005ec:text","row":29376,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"得物を取り出すぞと言わんばかりに。","en":"As though I meant to draw a weapon.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800204","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00010","en":"I'm gonna take out my special weapon!, screams the motion,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000626:text","row":29377,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"実際は乳首が痒かったからだ。","en":"In truth, my nipple itched.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800205","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00011","en":"but in truth it's because my nipple was itchy.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000724:text","row":29378,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ッッ！」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800206","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00012","en":"Kiri: \"...!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000074a:text","row":29379,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"霧は過敏に警戒した。","en":"Kiri went instantly on guard.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800207","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00013","en":"Kiri was nervously vigilant.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000776:text","row":29380,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"すっと、ポケットに手を入れる。","en":"Her hand slid into her pocket.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800208","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00014","en":"Suddenly, she puts her hand in the pocket.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000007ac:text","row":29381,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"ヤツも得物をっ！","en":"She was going for her weapon too!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800209","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00015","en":"The girl has has special weapon too!","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","typography"],"assessment":"The duplicated verb makes the English sentence ungrammatical.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":16,"start":9,"text":"has has"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000007dc:text","row":29382,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「く」","en":"“Kh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800210","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00016","en":"Taichi: \"Gah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000007fa:text","row":29383,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"俺は懐に手を入れたまま、さらに眼力を強めた。","en":"Keeping my hand inside my jacket, I sharpened my glare.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800211","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00017","en":"With hand still in the breast pocket, I strengthened the sharpness of my sight furthermore.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000008c7:text","row":29384,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"バチバチバチバチバチッッッ！！","en":"Cracklecracklecracklecrackle!!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800212","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00018","en":"CrackleCrackleCrackleCrackleCrackleee!!!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000008fd:text","row":29385,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"向こうもポケットから手を出さない。","en":"She kept her hand in her pocket too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800213","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00019","en":"My antagonist doesn't remove the hand from her pocket either.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000937:text","row":29386,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"膠着状態。","en":"A stalemate.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800214","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00020","en":"Deadlock.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000959:text","row":29387,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"クイック＆ドロウ。","en":"Quick and draw.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800215","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00021","en":"Quick'n'draw.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000983:text","row":29388,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"先に動いた方がやられる。","en":"The first to move would lose.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800216","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00022","en":"The first to move is finished.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000009b3:text","row":29389,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"そこに手をふきふき、美希が出てきた。トイレから。","en":"Then Miki emerged from the restroom, wiping her hands.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800217","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00023","en":"And there, going wipey-wipey on her hands, Miki came out of the toilet.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000a9e:text","row":29390,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「わーーんっ、トイレしてた隙に修羅場になってるーーーっ！！」","en":"“Waaah! I went to the bathroom for one second and came back to a showdown!!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800218","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00024","en":"Miki: \"Bwaaah, in the time I went to the toilet it turned into a fight sceeeeene!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000afa:text","row":29391,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「今助けてやるからな美希！」","en":"“I’ll save you, Miki!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800219","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00025","en":"Taichi: \"That's because I've come to rescue you, Miki!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The Japanese promises an imminent rescue; the English instead gives the rescue as the reason for a prior arrival.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":55,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"That's because I've come to rescue you, Miki!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000b53:text","row":29392,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「囚われている設定になっている……」","en":"“Now I’m the captive in this scenario…”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800220","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00026","en":"Miki: \"Scenario is me being held captive then...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000bb2:text","row":29393,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「さがって、美希」","en":"“Stay back, Miki.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800221","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00027","en":"Kiri: \"Step back, Miki.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000c01:text","row":29394,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、だから……」","en":"“No, that’s what I’m trying to—”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800222","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00028","en":"Miki: \"No, I told you...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000c2d:text","row":29395,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"霧が腰を落とす。","en":"Kiri lowered her stance.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800223","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00029","en":"Kiri slacks off her hips.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese describes lowering the hips into a stance; the highlighted phrase does not convey that motion.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":24,"start":5,"text":"slacks off her hips"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000c5d:text","row":29396,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「……フッ」","en":"“...Hmph.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800224","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00030","en":"Taichi: \"...huh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000c81:text","row":29397,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"俺は肩の力を抜いた。","en":"I let the tension out of my shoulders.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800225","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00031","en":"I remove the tension from my shoulder.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000cad:text","row":29398,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"手も抜く。","en":"And withdrew my hand.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800226","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00032","en":"And remove the hand.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000d99:text","row":29399,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「……っ」","en":"“……!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800227","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00033","en":"Kiri: \"...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000dbb:text","row":29400,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"空手だ。","en":"My hand was empty.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800228","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00034","en":"Empty hands mine, the kind you'd write kara-te.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000ddb:text","row":29401,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"ひらひらと、無防備な様を示す。","en":"I fluttered my hands to display my defenselessness.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800229","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00035","en":"They flutter around delicately, showing my defenseless state.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000e19:text","row":29402,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「ハッタリのかましあいはここまでだ、霧ちん」","en":"“Our exchange of bluffs ends here, Kiri-kins.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800230","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00036","en":"Taichi: \"Our bluffs end here, Kiri-chin.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000e65:text","row":29403,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「こちらは武装していない。そちらも無意味な虚勢はやめたまえ」","en":"“I am unarmed. Do put an end to your empty posturing.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800231","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00037","en":"Taichi: \"I sport weaponlessness on my side. So gladden me by ceasing meaningless bluffs on yours.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice"],"assessment":"The Japanese ending is a commanding speech-form marker, not the lexical verb in the highlight.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":54,"start":47,"text":"gladden"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000eb9:text","row":29404,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"たまえ、とか言ってる俺はどこまでも格好いい。","en":"There I was, coming out with lines like “Do put an end to…” I was impossibly cool.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800232","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00038","en":"When use words like 'gladden' I am in all respects cool.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","wordplay"],"assessment":"The Japanese explicitly comments on the preceding imperative ending; the English substitutes an unrelated lexical word and breaks the metalinguistic reference.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":21,"text":"gladden"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000efd:text","row":29405,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"純愛貴族の異名は伊達ではなかった。","en":"My epithet, the Nobleman of Pure Love, was no empty boast.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800233","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00039","en":"My nickname of The Aristocrat of Pure Love is no dandyism.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The idiom means that something is not merely for show; the highlighted noun is not its meaning here.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":57,"start":49,"text":"dandyism"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000f3d:text","row":29406,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800234","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00040","en":"Kiri: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000f61:text","row":29407,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"霧は手を抜いた。","en":"Kiri withdrew her hand.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800235","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00041","en":"Kiri took out her hand,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000f89:text","row":29408,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"クロスボウが握られていた。","en":"She was holding a crossbow.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800236","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00042","en":"and it was grasping a crossbow.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00000fc3:text","row":29409,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「……にゃ？」","en":"“…Mew?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800237","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00043","en":"Taichi: \"...nya～?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000010df:text","row":29410,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"バックマスター社製マックスポイントクロスボーーーーーーーっ！","en":"A Buckmaster Maxpoint Croooooossbow!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00044","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00044","en":"It's a Buckmaster Manufacture Maxpoint Crossbooooooooow!","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000113b:text","row":29411,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「待て待て待て待て」","en":"“Wait, wait, wait, wait.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800238","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00045","en":"Taichi: \"WaitWaitWaitWait!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000116f:text","row":29412,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「今のはおかしいぞ！　そんなサイズのものがポケットに入るわけないだろ！」","en":"“That makes no sense! There is no way something that size could fit in your pocket!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800239","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00046","en":"Taichi: \"That now was weird! A thing that size can't possibly fit inside a pocket!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000011f2:text","row":29413,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800240","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00047","en":"Kiri: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001216:text","row":29414,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"無言でクロスボウを構えている。","en":"Silently, she raised the crossbow.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800241","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00048","en":"Wordlessly she aims the crossbow.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000124c:text","row":29415,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"スコープの向こう、霧が俺の心臓を狙っているのがわかる。","en":"With Kiri behind the scope, I could tell she was aiming at my heart.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800242","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00049","en":"I know that on the other side of the scope Kiri is aiming at my heart.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000129a:text","row":29416,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"ひしひしと視線を感じた。","en":"I could feel her gaze bearing down on me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800243","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00050","en":"I can feel a very very sharp sight.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000012d2:text","row":29417,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「ブリキロボがあれほど欲しがっていた心を狙っているっ！？」","en":"“You’re aiming at the heart the Tin Man wanted so badly!?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800244","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00051","en":"Taichi: \"You're aiming for a heart with the intensity of the desire the Tin Robot had?!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wordplay","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese compares the target to the heart longed for by the Tin Man; the English changes who or what possesses the intensity and weakens the allusive relation.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":88,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"You're aiming for a heart with the intensity of the desire the Tin Robot had?!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001347:text","row":29418,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「動かないで下さい。撃ちますよ」","en":"“Do not move. I will shoot.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800245","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00052","en":"Kiri: \"Please do not move. I will shoot!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000013a4:text","row":29419,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「あわわわっ」","en":"“Awwwawawa!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800246","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00053","en":"Miki: \"AhWahWahWah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000013ca:text","row":29420,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"ミキミキも動転。","en":"MikiMiki had lost her head too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800247","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00054","en":"Miki-Miki's also quite upset.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000013fa:text","row":29421,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「降参降参！」","en":"“I surrender, I surrender!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800248","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00055","en":"Taichi: \"Uncle, uncle!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001420:text","row":29422,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"両手をあげる。","en":"I raised both hands.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800249","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00056","en":"I raise my hands.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001469:text","row":29423,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、狙いやすくなった……」","en":"“Oh. That made you easier to aim at…”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800250","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00057","en":"Kiri: \"Ah, aiming got easier...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000149d:text","row":29424,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"さらに狙いを定めた。","en":"She took even more careful aim.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800251","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00058","en":"She further refines her aim.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000014d1:text","row":29425,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「ノー！　ノー！　ヤメテー！」","en":"“No! No! Don’t do it!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800252","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00059","en":"Taichi: \"NOO! NOO! YAMETEEE!\" (No! No! Stop!)","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001507:text","row":29426,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"ぶんぶんとクビを振る。","en":"I shook my head violently.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800253","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00060","en":"Shake-shake, I shake my head.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001535:text","row":29427,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"泣きそう。","en":"I was ready to cry.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800254","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00061","en":"It's to cry.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","undertranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese describes someone as on the verge of tears; the English predicate is ungrammatical and does not express imminence.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":12,"start":0,"text":"It's to cry."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001557:text","row":29428,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"というか泣いてる。","en":"In fact, I was crying.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800255","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00062","en":"Or should say, I'm crying.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000015a6:text","row":29429,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧ちん、霧ちん！　マズイよ、逮捕されちゃうよ！」","en":"“Kiri-kins, Kiri-kins! This is bad! You’ll get arrested!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800256","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00063","en":"Miki: \"Kiri-chin, Kiri-chin! That's bad! You'll be arrested!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001613:text","row":29430,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「警察もういないし」","en":"“There are no police anymore.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800257","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00064","en":"Kiri: \"The police is gone by now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001664:text","row":29431,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっ、そうか」","en":"“Oh. Right.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800258","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00065","en":"Miki: \"Ah, right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000016b1:text","row":29432,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぽえー……」","en":"“Poeh…”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800259","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00066","en":"Miki: \"Zooom...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000016d7:text","row":29433,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"大人しくなった。","en":"She quieted down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800260","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00067","en":"And she turned obedient.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001707:text","row":29434,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「納得しないでー！」","en":"“Don’t accept that!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800261","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00068","en":"Taichi: \"Don't just asseeent!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001756:text","row":29435,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「膝を突いて、手を頭の後ろに」","en":"“On your knees. Hands behind your head.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800262","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00069","en":"Kiri: \"Get on your knees, hands behind your head.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001794:text","row":29436,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「はひ」","en":"“Yesh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800263","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00070","en":"Taichi: \"Hyesh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000017b4:text","row":29437,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"従う。","en":"I obeyed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800264","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00071","en":"I abide.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000017f5:text","row":29438,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「……次、どうしよう？」","en":"“…What should we do next?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800265","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00072","en":"Kiri: \"...next, what do we do?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001825:text","row":29439,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"美希とひそひそ会話する。","en":"She conferred with Miki in whispers.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800266","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00073","en":"A psst-psst of conversation with Miki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001855:text","row":29440,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"俺には聞こえる。","en":"I could hear them.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800267","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00074","en":"It's still audible to me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000018a2:text","row":29441,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"「武装解除は？」","en":"“Disarm him?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800268","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00075","en":"Miki: \"Did you disarm him?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000018ed:text","row":29442,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「何も持ってないみたい」","en":"“It looks like he has nothing.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800269","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00076","en":"Kiri: \"Doesn't seem to have anything with him.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001942:text","row":29443,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800270","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00077","en":"Miki: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001962:text","row":29444,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"思案。","en":"Miki thought it over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800271","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00078","en":"Thinking over.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000019a5:text","row":29445,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃあ、こんなのはどう？」","en":"“Then how about this?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800272","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00079","en":"Miki: \"Sooo, how about this?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000019d9:text","row":29446,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"囁く。","en":"She whispered.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800273","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00080","en":"Whisper.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001a1a:text","row":29447,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わかった」","en":"“All right.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800274","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00081","en":"Kiri: \"...got it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001a42:text","row":29448,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"霧は頷く。","en":"Kiri nodded.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800275","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00082","en":"Kiri nods.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001a64:text","row":29449,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"クールに見えて、実は美希にべったりなのである。","en":"She looked cool, but she was actually glued to Miki’s side.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800276","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00083","en":"She might look all cool, but in the truth she is very much clinging on to Miki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001aaa:text","row":29450,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"だから言いなり。","en":"So she did whatever Miki said.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800277","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00084","en":"Therefore, she is a yes-man to Miki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001ad2:text","row":29451,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"そこに活路はあった。","en":"There lay my escape route.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800278","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00085","en":"There was a route of escape there.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001afe:text","row":29452,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"ミキミキのことだから、長年可愛がってきた俺をうまく逃がしてくれるに違いない。","en":"Knowing MikiMiki, after all the years I had spent doting on her, surely she would find a way to let me escape.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800279","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00086","en":"Because this is Miki-Miki, she will skillfully let me escape owing to the many years through which I have held her precious, no mistake.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001b8a:text","row":29453,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"「這いつくばってワンと鳴いてください」","en":"“Get down on all fours and bark.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800280","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00087","en":"Kiri: \"Please get on hands and knees and woof.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001bd0:text","row":29454,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"「ミキミキーっ！！」","en":"“MikiMikiiii!!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800281","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00088","en":"Taichi: \"Miki-Mikiii!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001c33:text","row":29455,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"「にしし」","en":"“Heh heh heh.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800282","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00089","en":"Miki: \"HehShehSheh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001c55:text","row":29456,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"邪悪な笑み。","en":"An evil smile.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800283","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00090","en":"A wicked smile.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001c79:text","row":29457,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"この俺が、セクハラの仕返しをされている。","en":"She was taking revenge for all my sexual harassment.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800284","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00091","en":"Now that I am in this position, she can have revenge for my sexual harassment.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001cdc:text","row":29458,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"「はやく」","en":"“Hurry.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800285","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00092","en":"Kiri: \"Hurry.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001d06:text","row":29459,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぐ、ぐう……」","en":"“G-grr…”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800286","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00093","en":"Taichi: \"Guh, guuuh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001d2e:text","row":29460,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"やむなし。","en":"There was no other choice.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800287","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00094","en":"No choice.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001d50:text","row":29461,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"はいつくばる。","en":"I got down on all fours.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800288","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00095","en":"I get on my knees and grovel.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001d7e:text","row":29462,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わん」","en":"“...Woof.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800289","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00096","en":"Taichi: \"...woof.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001dc7:text","row":29463,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"「やる気が感じられなかったのでリテイク」","en":"“I didn’t feel any enthusiasm. Retake.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800290","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00097","en":"Miki: \"I couldn't really feel the motivation so retake.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001eb6:text","row":29464,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぎゃー！！」","en":"“Aaaagh!!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800291","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00098","en":"Taichi: \"Ghyaaa!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001edc:text","row":29465,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"恥の上塗り。","en":"Another layer of humiliation.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800292","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00099","en":"Shame piles on top of shame.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001f00:text","row":29466,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"基本といえば基本だが。","en":"A classic move, sure.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800293","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00100","en":"It's the basics of the basics, but,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001f2e:text","row":29467,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"自分がするのはつらかった。","en":"But being the one who had to do it was brutal.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800294","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00101","en":"when I'm the one subjected to it, it's heartreanding.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese refers to performing the action oneself; the English reverses agency and says the speaker is subjected to it.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":53,"start":0,"text":"when I'm the one subjected to it, it's heartreanding."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001f83:text","row":29468,"ordinal":102,"kind":"text","jp":"「リテイクです、先輩」","en":"“Retake, Taichi.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800295","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00102","en":"Kiri: \"Retake, Senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001fb9:text","row":29469,"ordinal":103,"kind":"text","jp":"「ワン、ワンワンワン！」","en":"“Woof! Woof woof woof!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800296","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00103","en":"Taichi: \"Woof, woof woof woof!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00001ff1:text","row":29470,"ordinal":104,"kind":"text","jp":"「これでどうだ文句あるか！」","en":"“How’s that? Any complaints!?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800297","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00104","en":"Taichi: \"How're you gonna complain about this now!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000204a:text","row":29471,"ordinal":105,"kind":"text","jp":"「誰が四回も鳴けと言った、って」","en":"“Say, ‘Who told you to bark four times?’”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800298","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00105","en":"Miki: \"Ask him, who toldja to bark four times.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000208a:text","row":29472,"ordinal":106,"kind":"text","jp":"「オイ！」","en":"“Hey!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800299","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00106","en":"Taichi: \"HEY!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000020cf:text","row":29473,"ordinal":107,"kind":"text","jp":"「誰が四回も鳴けといいましたか？」","en":"“Who told you to bark four times?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800300","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00107","en":"Kiri: \"Who told you to bark four times?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00002111:text","row":29474,"ordinal":108,"kind":"text","jp":"「ＯＫわかった。さあ、どの靴を舐めればいいんだ？　ん？」","en":"“Okay, I get it. So, which shoe do you want me to lick? Hm?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800301","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00108","en":"Taichi: \"Okieh, I get it. So, whose shoes am I supposed to lick? Well?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00002186:text","row":29475,"ordinal":109,"kind":"text","jp":"「ためぐち？」","en":"“Are we speaking casually now?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800302","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00109","en":"Miki: \"Talking normally?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000021b4:text","row":29476,"ordinal":110,"kind":"text","jp":"「舐めさせていただきたく、姫君」","en":"“May I have the honor of licking it, my princess?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800303","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00110","en":"Taichi: \"I would be most grateful to be granted permission to lick, Princess-kun.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["name_address","addition"],"assessment":"The Japanese form means princess or lady and contains no masculine -kun suffix.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":80,"start":68,"text":"Princess-kun"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000021ec:text","row":29477,"ordinal":111,"kind":"text","jp":"額を床につけた。","en":"I pressed my forehead to the floor.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800304","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00111","en":"I laid my forehead on the floor.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00002239:text","row":29478,"ordinal":112,"kind":"text","jp":"「靴が汚れるのでいいです」","en":"“No. It would get my shoe dirty.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800305","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00112","en":"Miki: \"Our shoes would be filthied so we're good.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00002273:text","row":29479,"ordinal":113,"kind":"text","jp":"「ゥオイ！」","en":"“Heeey!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800306","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00113","en":"Taichi: \"wHEY!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000022bc:text","row":29480,"ordinal":114,"kind":"text","jp":"「……さあ、次はヌードショウですよ～」","en":"“…And now, it’s time for a nude show!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800307","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00114","en":"Miki: \"...sooo, next is a nude show yes it is～!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000022fa:text","row":29481,"ordinal":115,"kind":"text","jp":"美希が、美希が悪魔にっ！","en":"Miki—Miki had become a demon!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800308","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00115","en":"Miki... Miki is now a demon!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:0000234f:text","row":29482,"ordinal":116,"kind":"text","jp":"「下を脱ぐのです」","en":"“Strip from the waist down.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800309","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00116","en":"Miki: \"Now remove your belows.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:00002381:text","row":29483,"ordinal":117,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやー、カラダはいやー！」","en":"“Nooo! Not my body!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800310","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0026:00117","en":"Taichi: \"NOOOO!!! My body you caaaaan't!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0198:000023da:text","row":29484,"ordinal":118,"kind":"text","jp":"「命と貞操と、どっちが大切なんです